  "prefLabel": "Ath 103.04 Board Meetings and Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 103.04 Board Meetings and Quorum.\n\n(a) The board shall meet at least quarterly; and\n\n(b) A majority of the board’s members shall constitute a quorum.\n\nSource. #8345, eff 5-7-05; ss by #12946, eff 12-20-19 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ath 100); ss by #14373, eff 9-19-25",
